1
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,420
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,360
=Episode 9=

3
00:00:52,399 --> 00:00:55,399
The Wilds of Lize are famous
for their beauty in every season.

4
00:00:56,079 --> 00:00:58,520
It's a place many martial artists

5
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:00,600
and scholars dream of visiting.

6
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:04,439
But this is just a pile of graves!

7
00:01:04,959 --> 00:01:05,760
Strange.

8
00:01:06,319 --> 00:01:08,200
Something must be wrong.

9
00:01:16,239 --> 00:01:17,200
Well, Yuanchu,

10
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,680
did you find anything?

11
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,319
No sign of an entrance.

12
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,159
The Grand Demon Hunt

13
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,319
has drawn so many Hunters.

14
00:01:23,879 --> 00:01:25,480
Someone powerful must have

15
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,599
set up a barrier here.

16
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:36,239
Open up! Open up!

17
00:01:36,359 --> 00:01:36,840
Ziyan.

18
00:01:37,319 --> 00:01:38,200
What are you doing?

19
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,920
Nobody answers, so I knock.

20
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:40,359
Yuanchu,

21
00:01:40,519 --> 00:01:42,439
is she smashing
someone's ancestral grave?

22
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:43,359
Open up!

23
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,560
Our little junior is fierce.

24
00:01:46,239 --> 00:01:47,480
Don't mess with

25
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,760
that woman.

26
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:52,920
This layout follows the Eight Gates.

27
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,239
The Life Gate

28
00:01:54,719 --> 00:01:56,719
aligns with the celestial signs.

29
00:01:58,599 --> 00:02:01,200
Are you here for the Grand Demon Hunt?

30
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,719
Kneel! Kneel!

31
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,359
Kneel!

32
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:08,840
Kneel, kneel, kneel.

33
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:11,400
Kneel.

34
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:16,240
Please follow me.

35
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:50,439
Sir,

36
00:02:51,199 --> 00:02:51,919
come take a look!

37
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:53,000
So big!

38
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,840
So this is the real Wilds of Lize.

39
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,479
The Hunt has already
been going on for days.

40
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,199
We're out of time.

41
00:02:59,719 --> 00:03:00,960
Ziyan. Yuanchu.

42
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,240
No wandering. Let's move.

43
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,520
Miss, come take a look!

44
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:08,639
This place is not wild at all.
It's so fun!

45
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,120
Sir, what is this?

46
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:12,039
Ladies and gentlemen,

47
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:14,759
come see my finest wares!

48
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:16,039
As the saying goes,

49
00:03:16,039 --> 00:03:18,120
if you don't buy my treasures,

50
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:20,039
how will you ever win a lady's heart?

51
00:03:20,639 --> 00:03:21,639
Haha!

52
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:22,919
What about this one?

53
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,439
I promised I'd get you something.

54
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,599
Hope you like it.

55
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,039
Oh!

56
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,879
This gentleman has excellent taste!

57
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:36,280
This rouge box is no ordinary box.

58
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:39,560
It's called the Crimsonfrost Case.

59
00:03:39,759 --> 00:03:40,960
It can capture demons!

60
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,120
Little demons?

61
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:45,120
They're just a piece of cake.

62
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:47,759
Only five hundred taels of silver.

63
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:48,919
Five hundred?

64
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:50,120
Mm.

65
00:03:52,199 --> 00:03:53,000
Dear.

66
00:03:54,719 --> 00:03:56,319
To treat my illness,

67
00:03:56,599 --> 00:03:59,000
we sold our home.

68
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,479
We have nothing left.

69
00:04:01,199 --> 00:04:02,120
Forget it. Forget it.

70
00:04:02,879 --> 00:04:03,879
For my birthday this year,

71
00:04:04,479 --> 00:04:06,439
all I need is you by my side.

72
00:04:06,599 --> 00:04:07,719
I don't want it.

73
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:13,360
You... this... I... uh...

74
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:17,160
Cough, cough, cough.

75
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:19,440
Cough, cough, cough.

76
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:23,560
Ah!

77
00:04:24,079 --> 00:04:25,600
Honey!

78
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:26,800
Blood.

79
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:28,079
Dear!

80
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:29,360
Honey!

81
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,519
Blood...

82
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,439
You two must hold on!

83
00:04:36,759 --> 00:04:39,879
I'll sell you this box
for just twenty taels.

84
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,920
Dear!

85
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:47,800
Oh no!

86
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,399
I can't see anything!

87
00:04:51,399 --> 00:04:52,199
Dear.

88
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:56,759
Our poor child...

89
00:04:57,279 --> 00:04:59,240
not even born yet...

90
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:00,680
I...

91
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,800
Poor things.

92
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:07,360
Alright.

93
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:08,600
This box,

94
00:05:08,839 --> 00:05:10,040
and these pearls,

95
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,439
I'll give them to you.

96
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,399
A small token from me.

97
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,240
For your child's sake,

98
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:17,399
you must live on!

99
00:05:18,319 --> 00:05:21,360
Oh, we couldn't possibly... oh!

100
00:05:24,759 --> 00:05:25,680
Take a bit more.

101
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,560
Thank you so much.

102
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,120
Thank you.

103
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,439
Thank you, kind soul.

104
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,600
Thank you.

105
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:34,040
Take care of each other.

106
00:05:34,879 --> 00:05:35,480
Let's go.

107
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,600
I'm not done looking!

108
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,639
That's so sad!

109
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:38,639
Goodness...

110
00:05:40,250 --> 00:05:43,043
(Junzi City, the Wilds of Lize)

111
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:46,920
Though he is a demon,

112
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,000
you can't just torture him like that.

113
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:50,079
(Martial Elites, Gathered Here)
He crossed me.

114
00:05:50,079 --> 00:05:51,319
He should have known the consequences.

115
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,560
Stay out of it.

116
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,000
Young Master.

117
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:56,160
The strong strike at the stronger.

118
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,160
The weak bully the weaker.

119
00:05:58,720 --> 00:05:59,519
What you're doing

120
00:06:00,079 --> 00:06:01,040
is not what Hunters should do.

121
00:06:01,439 --> 00:06:03,920
Oh please, everyone knows you,

122
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:06,040
the young master of the Xuanwu Sect,

123
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,959
are a total failure.

124
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,160
You...

125
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:11,959
Compared to your talented brothers,

126
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,959
you should know

127
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:15,399
that a weakling protects no one.

128
00:06:15,759 --> 00:06:16,879
Come to think of it,

129
00:06:16,879 --> 00:06:19,319
you should really
be calling me sister-in-law.

130
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,000
Hahaha!

131
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:21,800
Hit him!

132
00:06:22,639 --> 00:06:23,360
Ah!

133
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,839
Do not hit me!

134
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,639
Do not hit me!

135
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:35,759
- My Lord.
- My Lord.

136
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,160
Who is there?

137
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,519
I...

138
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,560
You... you hit my face!

139
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:42,600
I just put on my rouge this morning!

140
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,680
So what? I hit you.

141
00:06:44,879 --> 00:06:45,519
You...

142
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:46,600
Good. Stay mad.

143
00:06:46,879 --> 00:06:49,160
But you did get one thing right.

144
00:06:49,439 --> 00:06:51,319
A weakling can't protect anyone.

145
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,199
But you're wrong about one thing.

146
00:06:53,279 --> 00:06:54,759
You're the real weakling here.

147
00:06:54,759 --> 00:06:56,079
You're the scum of the human world.

148
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:56,920
You what?

149
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:57,959
Y-Y-You...

150
00:06:59,959 --> 00:07:00,759
Hmph.

151
00:07:04,079 --> 00:07:05,000
Are you okay?

152
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,000
A goddess

153
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,360
has descended from the heavens.

154
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,360
After hunting demons for so long,

155
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,759
I finally got to punch a real person.

156
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:18,879
Xuanwu Sect,

157
00:07:19,079 --> 00:07:19,959
the Huanxi Valley's

158
00:07:20,079 --> 00:07:21,680
largest Hunter organization.

159
00:07:21,839 --> 00:07:23,600
Their reach spans the entire world.

160
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:25,040
Since you know that,

161
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:27,560
I'll give every one of you
a quick death.

162
00:07:28,079 --> 00:07:31,839
Too bad I'm not impressed.

163
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,319
Goddess, watch out!

164
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:47,680
Who dares cause trouble
at my Ruyi Pavilion?

165
00:07:48,839 --> 00:07:49,959
In the Wilds of Lize,

166
00:07:50,199 --> 00:07:51,360
humans and demons coexist.

167
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,560
All beings are equal.

168
00:07:52,879 --> 00:07:54,560
If you cause any more trouble,

169
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:57,399
my Shape Shifting Ruyi Vessel

170
00:07:58,079 --> 00:08:00,040
can refine humans and demons alike.

171
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,480
Hmph.

172
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:09,000
Fine. Since Fengniang is here,

173
00:08:09,079 --> 00:08:10,639
I'll spare you this time.

174
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,199
Next time,

175
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,040
you won't be so lucky.

176
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:15,240
Let's go.

177
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,040
Fengniang?

178
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,040
That voice...

179
00:08:22,759 --> 00:08:23,759
Those eyes...

180
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,279
Mm.

181
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:28,000
Lanxi?

182
00:08:45,483 --> 00:08:49,411
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

183
00:08:49,683 --> 00:08:52,856
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

184
00:08:52,897 --> 00:08:56,411
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

185
00:08:56,597 --> 00:08:59,531
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

186
00:08:59,811 --> 00:09:06,581
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

187
00:09:07,227 --> 00:09:13,915
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

188
00:09:14,821 --> 00:09:18,491
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

189
00:09:18,601 --> 00:09:22,291
♪I shatter the hollow fate
they wrote for me♪

190
00:09:22,463 --> 00:09:28,697
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
